WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Nathan,
thank you for being here.

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:02.635 line:92%
Thank you for spending your

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
