You're my favorite.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:07.140 line:92%
I'm gonna say it out loud.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're my
favorite talk-show host.

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:11.611 line:92%
-That is so kind of you to say.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:15.081
-And I think it's because
I didn't go to college,

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:17.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you're like
the frat bro I never had.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:17.884 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, thank you.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:20.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I look at you and I think,
"We're gonna have fun.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.321 line:92%
We're gonna do Jell-O shots.

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're gonna chat up
some fine ladies.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.057 line:92%
We're gonna make a night of it.

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:27.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
And we haven't done that once.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.563
Well, now I also aspire to that.
-Oh, me too.

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:32.232 line:92%
I'm sorry I was a little late.

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:32.966 size:78% position:39% line:92%
My security clearance

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:35.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
