was downgraded.

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:35.735 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, no.

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:38.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, so, technically,
I'm not even a guest tonight.

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:40.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm now an NBC page.
-Oh, no.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, I can
answer your questions,

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:46.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I will have to
get back to my tour group.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:49.716 line:92%
And they say I'm not topical.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, seriously,
I'm beginning to worry for

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.221
Jared Kushner, 'cause he's
way too pretty for prison.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.791 line:92%
-Oh, yeah. He's very handsome.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:58.391 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Very handsome.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:02.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, for
The White House, yeah.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:06.533
-Wait. Are you saying there's
a lower bar The White House?

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:07.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think so.
-Okay.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.437 line:92%
-It starts right at the top.

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:13.339 line:92%
-I want to ask about the Oscars.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:14.407 line:92%
They were presented last night.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, don't tell me who won.
I DVR'ed it.

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
And don't tell
me Best Sound Mixing

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.713 size:81% position:41% line:92%
