00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:52.979 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes, it was nice.

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:53.880 line:92%
-And I was very happy that

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
