00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:04.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
But everybody's favorite movie
is "Black Panther."

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I loved "Black Panther."

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:06.459 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, you did?

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
