it's anti-climatic.

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:35.188 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It is.

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:41.561
-The week before, I saw the
AARP Movies For Grownups Awards.

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:43.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
